## Description

Google Brain founder, Andrew Ng:  "Prompting will be dead in 6 months, graphs are what's replacing it."  In 2 hours at Stanford he shows how to build agents that work and improve entirely on their own.  The first 10 minutes alone cover what most $500 courses never touch.  Watch https://t.co/YN38lQ3osZ

